              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Engagement is the item's percentile rank in bid count among all active items: 0 for the fewest bids, 1 for the most. A value of 0.96 means the item has more bids than 96% of active items. Because most items have only a few bids, an item can reach a high Engagement score with a moderate number of bids, while additional bids change the score very little near the top.",
